<http://data.silknow.org/object/1a07eb63-83c7-3527-957d-1dfd6e1018d5>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pair of woman's boots of cotton, England, ca. 1820"@en , "Pair of woman's boots of beige cotton. They have a front lacing band with a matching silk ribbon as is the junction with the toe cap. The laces are of silk cord. A matching ribbon bow trims the front of the right boot and there are traces of an attachment of a similar one on the left. The heels are low, leather covered and wedge shaped. They reach above the ankle."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/f36620d6-e772-3504-9c27-442b3e528be6> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b4e36df5-e727-324a-bd95-f74e6a114c1c> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Pair of woman's boots of cotton, England, ca. 1820"@en , "Pair of woman's boots of beige cotton. They have a front lacing band with a matching silk ribbon as is the junction with the toe cap. The laces are of silk cord. A matching ribbon bow trims the front of the right boot and there are traces of an attachment of a similar one on the left. The heels are low, leather covered and wedge shaped. They reach above the ankle."@en ;
